# Butler Routes - Tanaris completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Tanaris accept in the local census (91 quests, docs/tanaris-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The 10 Horde-accept
# quests stay with the Horde block's census; 2 Lunar Festival elders, 9
# repeatables, 49 above-band records (the AQ scepter chain, the ectoplasm
# chain, one EPL link) and 1 broken record are out with reasons in the census.
# No race header and no class gates: nothing contracted is race- or
# class-locked. Profession lines ride `when skill` gates with bag notes;
# item- and object-started quests never wedge (note at the source, sourcing
# optional or honest bag notes where the data holds no source). Accepts whose
# pres sit outside every pack contract ride dedicated `when onquest`
# mini-steps, each standing alone. Expedition turn-ins
# (Darnassus, Booty Bay, Thousand Needles, Ironforge, Teldrassil, Un'Goro,
# Feralas, the Hinterlands, Badlands, Durotar and the 2548 mooring) switch
# frames with zone map lines and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tanaris
title Tanaris - Completionist
levels 38-50
zone Tanaris
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Gadgetzan - landfall

  zone map 1446

  tip Gadgetzan holds the chains: Fizzledowser (50.21, 27.48) runs the water survey, Pestlezugg (50.89, 26.96) the silithid work, Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle (52.46, 28.51) the Wastewander bounties, Trenton (51.41, 28.75) the mithril work, Marin (51.81, 28.66) the noggenfogger line, Curgle (52.36, 26.91) the coast photography, Dirge (52.63, 28.11) the cooking, Nixx (52.48, 27.33) the engineering, Derotain (51.38, 28.67) the armorsmithing, Tran'rek (51.57, 26.76) the south work, Andi Lynn (52.82, 27.4) the Dunemaul ask, Fizbuz (51.66, 27.83) the Tazzik end, and Fizzgrimble (52.51, 27.91) keeps the inn. The WANTED board (51.83, 27.04) names Caliph Scorpidsting. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  accept 992 -- Gadgetzan Water Survey - Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser; the Dowsing Widget at the Sandsorrow hole
  accept 2781 -- WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting - the board; Caliph roams north-east
  note 2771, 2772 and 2773 need 2760 (The Mithril Order, from McGavan in Stranglethorn) first - take Trenton's trio in its own soft-pre step once 2760 is done.
  accept 3042 -- Troll Temper - Trenton Lighthammer; twenty Troll Temper
  accept 2605 -- The Thirsty Goblin - Marin Noggenfogger; a Laden Dew Gland, south
  accept 5863 -- The Dunemaul Compound - Andi Lynn; Dunemaul ogres, far south-west
  accept 3362 -- Thistleshrub Valley - Tran'rek; thistleshrubs, far south-west
  accept 4504 -- Super Sticky - Tran'rek; Super Sticky Tar, in Un'Goro, late
  note 2944 needs 2941 (The Borrower, from Daryn Lightwind in Teldrassil) first - take the Snapper in its own soft-pre step once 2941 is done.
  accept 3022 only Alliance -- Handle With Care - Curgle Cranklehop; Erelas takes it in Teldrassil, late
  note 6610 needs 6612 (I Know A Guy, from Daryl Riknussun in Ironforge) first - take the Clamlette in its own soft-pre step once 6612 is done.
  accept 95144 -- Overseas Delivery - Innkeeper Fizzgrimble; Friz Frazzlespark waits at the 2548 mooring, late
  accept 2741 -- The Super Egg-O-Matic - the Egg-O-Matic; a Hippogryph Egg, in Feralas, late
  note 1189 needs 1188 (Safety First, from Razzeric in Thousand Needles) first - take it in its own soft-pre step once 1188 is done.
  accept 351 -- Find OOX-17/TN! - the Distress Beacon in your bags; the Homing Robot waits far south
  note The OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon (351's starter) is a zone-wide world drop - the guide never wedges on it: bank one if it drops elsewhere, take the quest at the Homing Robot when you have it.
  accept 1707 -- Water Pouch Bounty - Spigot Operator Luglunket; Wastewander pouches
  accept 1690 -- Wastewander Justice - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; bandits and thieves, east
  accept 2768 -- Divino-matic Rod - Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle; the rod, off Sergeant Bly
  note Sergeant Bly (Divino-matic Rod, 2768) has no placed spawn in the data - no complete is plotted; take the quest now, find Bly with a group, hand in on return.
  complete 2768 -- Divino-matic Rod for Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  turnin 2768 -- Divino-matic Rod - the rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 3638 -- The Pledge of Secrecy - Nixx Sprocketspring; his signed pledge
  note Nixx's Signed Pledge (3638) has no placed source in the data - he signs it at his bench; no complete is plotted.
  complete 3638 -- Nixx's signed pledge for Nixx Sprocketspring
  turnin 3638 -- The Pledge of Secrecy - back to Nixx Sprocketspring

